13
01:15:15,789 --> 01:15:21,789
Breach is a 2007 American spy thriller film directed by Billy Ray, who
wrote the screenplay with Adam Mazer and William Rotko.

14
01:21:03,157 --> 01:21:09,157
The film is based on the true story of Robert Hanssen, an FBI agent convicted of
spying for the Soviet Union and later Russia for more than two decades.

15
01:26:50,526 --> 01:26:56,526
It stars Chris Cooper as Hanssen and Ryan Phillippe as Eric O'Neill, the
FBI investigator who helped bring about Hanssen's downfall.

16
01:32:37,894 --> 01:32:43,894
The film received generally positive reviews and
grossed $41 million on a $23 million budget.

17
01:38:25,263 --> 01:38:31,263
The film explores themes of undercover, spy, fbi, loyalty, suspicion.

18
01:44:12,631 --> 01:44:18,631
The tone is emotional and thought_provoking and intense.
